# Derived by hand from ruling TC and Semantics ch. 8 (a widget application is transparent; a `$` field is live, so the place changes in place): the button is 0, levels 20 down to 1 take places 1 to 20, the last clause's label 21, and the caller's label the next number, 22; the click feeds every level's own hold in its tick.
